<title>POLAND: COMPUTERLAND AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>COMPUTERLAND AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.68 vs   0.55</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.18 vs   0.77</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.99 vs   0.57</p>
<p> Sales		   11.74 vs   8.65</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.49 vs   3.22</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	10.09 vs   4.81</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.30 vs   4.26</p>
<p> Sales		   96.15 vs  49.78</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish computer software firm is</p>
<p>ComputerLand SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
